"- See the [API references](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit Runtime primitives](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives), which are used for running circuits on IBM QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
